WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:34.660 --> 01:35.160
Ouch!

01:35.960 --> 01:38.630
This is your punishment for doing something so dangerous without my permission!

01:38.630 --> 01:40.730
I told you time and again to be careful!

01:40.730 --> 01:42.800
Okay, I won't do it again! That hurts!

01:42.800 --> 01:47.730
If me and Houx and Saule hadn't come to
save you, you'd have been in big trouble!

01:48.900 --> 01:50.000
Serves her right!

01:50.440 --> 01:53.040
So Pierre is an Ogre, isn't he...?

01:53.040 --> 01:56.440
Yeah, but I was so close to getting his heart!

01:56.440 --> 01:57.970
Liar!

01:59.280 --> 02:00.510
Oww!

02:01.850 --> 02:05.190
Have you ever heard the
saying "Curiosity killed the cat"?

02:05.190 --> 02:07.520
Don't go near him again.

02:07.920 --> 02:11.520
I won't let you get away with
acting on your own like this again.

02:11.830 --> 02:17.100
Then tell me! What's an Ogre? Where are
they from? What's their purpose? Pierre–

02:17.100 --> 02:19.600
I'm heading back to the Magical World.

02:19.600 --> 02:22.530
I guess I've got a bunch of
stuff to report to the senate.

02:25.240 --> 02:28.240
It's better for you two not to know any more about it.

02:28.240 --> 02:32.010
As Queen Candidates, you have
more important things to worry about.

02:32.010 --> 02:32.610
But...

02:33.310 --> 02:37.350
Be good while I'm gone, and don't go near Pierre.

02:37.350 --> 02:38.620
Okay? You understand?

02:41.260 --> 02:42.250
Okay...

02:44.830 --> 02:48.280
The Creation of the Magical World,
The Secret of the Ogres

02:48.700 --> 02:49.930
As if...

02:50.570 --> 02:53.100
I ain't gonna sit around behaving!

02:53.100 --> 02:54.700
Chocolat-chan...

02:54.700 --> 02:58.010
I'm gonna try going to the
Magical World and finding out myself.

02:59.010 --> 03:00.490
Don't, Chocolat-chan!

03:00.490 --> 03:04.080
If you do that, you'll be disqualified as a Queen Candidate for sure this time!

03:04.080 --> 03:06.680
That's why I just can't get caught.

03:06.680 --> 03:10.520
That's impossible. Do you really think you can do it?

03:10.520 --> 03:11.920
And how were you planning to, anyway?

03:14.160 --> 03:16.420
Oh, you haven't thought that far ahead, I see.

03:17.960 --> 03:20.060
Vanilla-chama, you missed a big chance!

03:20.530 --> 03:23.300
Chocolat almost got herself disqualified!

03:24.500 --> 03:26.700
Robin-sensei finally left, huh?

03:27.170 --> 03:29.060
He got you pretty good, Chocolat.

03:29.400 --> 03:30.510
Oh, be quiet, you.

03:30.510 --> 03:33.940
Oh? That's not the way you talk
to someone who saved your life.

03:33.940 --> 03:37.110
If I could just go back to the
Magical World and figure this stuff out...

03:37.110 --> 03:38.010
Sure you can.

03:39.480 --> 03:43.030
We're going back tomorrow. Aren't you two going?

03:43.590 --> 03:45.030
What are you talking about?

03:45.520 --> 03:47.740
Here. Didn't you get one?

03:48.120 --> 03:49.390
What's that?

03:49.390 --> 03:52.560
A wedding invitation.
For Kouglof-sensei's wedding!

03:53.630 --> 03:55.930
Kouglof-sensei is getting married?

03:55.930 --> 03:57.960
Yeah! His fiancee's pretty cute.

03:59.830 --> 04:02.800
But that's weird, we never got an invitation.

04:02.800 --> 04:03.500
Yeah.

04:04.110 --> 04:05.140
Now that you mention it...!

04:12.080 --> 04:13.710
Is that a letter from the Magical World?

04:14.980 --> 04:16.720
I'll give it to them later.

04:20.860 --> 04:22.890
I totally forgot about it.

04:22.890 --> 04:24.190
Duke...

04:25.390 --> 04:28.060
I'm gonna whup your butt!

04:31.100 --> 04:33.940
I'm sorry! I'm against violence!

04:33.940 --> 04:37.770
If you like afternoon naps so much,
I'll make it so you'll never wake up!

04:38.440 --> 04:40.470
Chocolat-chan, I got the letter.

04:41.480 --> 04:42.010
Really?

04:46.010 --> 04:48.220
Chocolat, Vanilla, are you well?

04:48.220 --> 04:51.050
You see, I'm going to get married.

04:51.050 --> 04:52.850
This is my wife.

04:52.850 --> 04:55.520
Chocolat-chan, Vanilla-chan, nice to meet you.

04:55.860 --> 04:58.530
Wow, she's really beautiful.

04:59.130 --> 05:02.460
I really hope you two can come to our wedding.

05:02.460 --> 05:04.130
I got permission for you to come.

05:04.630 --> 05:05.730
Okay, see you there.

05:08.200 --> 05:11.910
Isn't that great, Chocolat-chan? Now we
can go back without breaking the rules.

05:11.910 --> 05:19.110
Kouglof-sensei wouldn't get married
anytime soon, but it's nice timing for us.

05:19.110 --> 05:21.050
They're getting married
just at the right time.

05:21.450 --> 05:23.480
Then you two are going, right?

05:23.480 --> 05:24.260
Of course!

05:24.690 --> 05:27.490
The wedding ceremony is
tomorrow. You have to hurry!

05:27.490 --> 05:28.760
Do you know what you're going to wear?

05:29.560 --> 05:32.290
I think I should wear a bowtie.

05:32.790 --> 05:34.190
You're staying home, Duke.

05:35.130 --> 05:36.960
That's your punishment for forgetting the letter.

05:36.960 --> 05:38.570
But...

05:40.130 --> 05:41.840
You stay home too, Blanca.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.990
I don't want to leave Duke all alone.

05:45.340 --> 05:50.140
What did you say? Being alone
together with him? That's the worst!

05:50.140 --> 05:52.810
Hey, that's my line!

05:52.810 --> 05:54.780
Please stop fighting, you two!

05:54.780 --> 05:57.450
That's right. Make sure to watch the house, okay?

06:00.920 --> 06:03.320
Alright, let's go. Vanilla!

06:03.320 --> 06:04.060
Yeah.

06:05.890 --> 06:08.230
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

06:10.260 --> 06:12.500
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

06:14.470 --> 06:16.480
Open, door in the moon!

06:16.840 --> 06:17.440
There!

06:28.620 --> 06:29.360
Yahoo!

06:33.590 --> 06:35.490
The wedding chapel is over there.

06:54.980 --> 06:57.020
Hey, everyone!

06:58.980 --> 06:59.980
Chocolat!

06:59.980 --> 07:00.980
Chocolat-chan!

07:01.520 --> 07:03.980
Yay! Long time no see, everyone!

07:04.450 --> 07:05.820
Came back, did you?

07:05.820 --> 07:07.990
And I just got used to you being gone...

07:08.460 --> 07:12.360
So you're still alive? I figured
you'd have bit the big one by now.

07:12.360 --> 07:15.240
I heard you got swallowed by a mouse!

07:15.630 --> 07:18.900
We heard from Kougrof-sensei that he invited you.

07:19.370 --> 07:20.750
Big-mouth was coming!

07:20.750 --> 07:24.940
It's so shocking that that teacher would get married.

07:24.940 --> 07:26.870
The skeletons in the graveyard are still laughing!

07:30.140 --> 07:32.680
Oh, Chocolat-chan, I haven't seen you in so long.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.550
Doing well, I see?

07:34.420 --> 07:35.280
Oba-san!

07:35.780 --> 07:36.680
And Oji-san, too?

07:37.190 --> 07:39.290
Still as close as ever, huh?

07:40.150 --> 07:43.160
Yes. Right, Papa?

07:43.160 --> 07:44.460
Yes, Mama.

07:48.300 --> 07:50.300
Stop it, will you? Papa, Mama!

07:50.800 --> 07:51.500
That's right...

07:52.170 --> 07:55.800
I baked "that pie," so
everyone, make sure to eat it later, okay?

07:56.570 --> 07:59.310
Really? I love "that pie"!

07:59.870 --> 08:02.080
Yay! Thanks, Oba-san!

08:34.180 --> 08:36.180
Congratulations, Kougrof-sensei!

08:43.820 --> 08:44.650
Wonderful...

09:14.920 --> 09:17.620
Their two, crimson hearts...

09:17.620 --> 09:22.420
With only one heart, how can we get married?

09:23.120 --> 09:26.030
Two lovers who want to get
married exchange their hearts.

09:27.230 --> 09:30.500
The only person you love...
You ask them to hold your life.

09:30.500 --> 09:34.130
And you hold your loved one's life in return.

09:36.440 --> 09:40.710
But what if they aren't faithful to
you, and one day change their mind?

09:40.710 --> 09:42.640
Yeah, you can't trust anybody.

09:43.240 --> 09:44.810
Especially Chocolat.

09:44.810 --> 09:45.480
Yeah.

09:46.680 --> 09:47.980
If that happens, you will die.

09:49.720 --> 09:52.730
You will be alone in the endless dark...

10:09.290 --> 10:12.470
Congratulations!

10:18.300 --> 10:23.320
Your one and only life...
Your one and only truth...

10:25.050 --> 10:32.230
That one and only person... Will I ever meet someone I feel that way about, I wonder?

10:58.120 --> 11:02.220
This is so fun! It's been a long
time since everyone was so lively!

11:02.220 --> 11:06.430
Yeah, lately it's been a real downer with
all the Ogre stuff going on around here.

11:07.630 --> 11:08.260
Ogres?

11:09.630 --> 11:14.100
Hey, what are Ogres? Where
are they? What're their intentions?

11:14.100 --> 11:17.170
Dunno. We don't really know much, either.

11:17.670 --> 11:22.810
I hate those Ogres. They oppose us, right?

11:22.810 --> 11:24.710
Yeah, they're kind of scary.

11:24.710 --> 11:27.010
The senate's told us to be on the lookout for them.

11:28.520 --> 11:31.950
And lately they've really
upped the security around La Palais.

11:33.220 --> 11:34.350
So that's how it is.

11:36.460 --> 11:38.960
Thanks for waiting. The pie is finished!

11:40.290 --> 11:41.330
It's "that pie"!

11:41.330 --> 11:42.660
"That pie"!

11:42.660 --> 11:44.460
I made it a special large size.

11:46.270 --> 11:47.700
Is everyone ready?

11:48.770 --> 11:51.910
Sucre Sucre Sale!

12:02.250 --> 12:06.120
They're special bats! When you
catch them, they turn into cookies!

12:06.120 --> 12:09.390
Whoever catches the gold
colored one gets to be the King!

12:10.390 --> 12:14.580
There! I got a cherry-colored one!

12:15.230 --> 12:17.090
And I got a blueberry one!

12:17.570 --> 12:20.370
Your pie's as big a hit as always, Mama.

12:21.240 --> 12:23.340
Thank you, darling.

12:23.340 --> 12:25.540
I got the gold bat!

12:28.480 --> 12:31.380
A ginger cookie with raisins and walnuts!

12:31.380 --> 12:33.580
Aw, Chocolat wins again.

12:34.050 --> 12:37.850
So, since you're the King, you can
give anyone one order you want.

12:37.850 --> 12:40.360
Um... In that case...

12:41.990 --> 12:44.070
I'm gonna give an order to Sensei and his wife!

12:44.460 --> 12:49.080
Definitely, definitely, be the happiest
couple in the whole Magical World!

12:49.660 --> 12:51.260
If you don't, I'll whup your butts!

12:51.970 --> 12:53.570
Sure thing, Chocolat.

12:53.570 --> 12:56.700
Thanks, we'll make sure to be
the happiest couple in the world.

12:56.700 --> 12:57.630
Very well.

13:00.340 --> 13:02.290
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

13:02.740 --> 13:03.480
Chocolat?

13:10.450 --> 13:13.990
Sorry, Vanilla. Two of us would stick out too much.

13:13.990 --> 13:18.090
If I want to find out about the Ogres,
Queen Candy should be the first person to ask.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.800
It's shrouded in darkness.

13:23.800 --> 13:25.770
Is this some kind of barrier?

13:27.300 --> 13:28.470
I can't see La Palais!

13:32.210 --> 13:34.010
Le Ruban du douleur!

13:34.010 --> 13:35.070
Ribbon of pain!

13:36.010 --> 13:37.140
Huh? What's this?

13:43.220 --> 13:46.820
Oww... I feel like rose thorns
are stinging my entire body...

13:50.690 --> 13:53.160
Spice needles are tucked
inside the ribbons.

13:53.160 --> 13:55.600
The more you move, the more
they'll sting you.

13:57.030 --> 13:58.770
I'm not anyone suspicious...

13:59.170 --> 14:00.800
That's not my concern!

14:00.800 --> 14:04.280
I'll defeat anyone who tried to get into La Palais!

14:04.670 --> 14:07.580
I want to see Queen Candy!

14:07.580 --> 14:08.780
Please...

14:09.910 --> 14:12.270
You want to see the Queen? Don't make me laugh!

14:14.450 --> 14:16.850
I won't hold back just because you're a kid.

14:16.850 --> 14:17.580
You damn Ogre.

14:18.990 --> 14:22.090
Please, let me see the Queen...

14:26.960 --> 14:28.380
Chocolat Meilleure?

14:33.970 --> 14:36.500
Captain of the Queen's
Guard... Being a bit hasty, aren't we?

14:38.410 --> 14:40.870
Are you okay? Hang in there, Chocolat.

14:42.380 --> 14:44.900
Please, let me see the Queen...

14:48.950 --> 14:52.620
Lately, the Ogres have been on the move.

14:52.620 --> 14:56.420
We've covered La Palais in a
barrier so you can't get near it easily.

14:58.130 --> 15:02.750
Since it was Chocolat Meilleure requesting it, the Queen has granted you a special audience.

15:03.200 --> 15:03.900
Thank you.

15:05.770 --> 15:08.800
Chocolat, I'm very sorry about what just happened.

15:09.640 --> 15:10.880
You're uninjured?

15:11.240 --> 15:12.770
Yes. I'm fine.

15:14.740 --> 15:17.910
I'm sorry about barging in so suddenly to see you.

15:19.150 --> 15:21.920
That's fine. So why did you want to see me?

15:27.660 --> 15:31.560
I'm sure Queen Candy
will understand. I'm sure of it.

15:34.630 --> 15:36.430
I want to know about the Ogres!

15:37.260 --> 15:41.000
Robin-sensei said that us Queen
Candidates had other things to worry about,

15:41.000 --> 15:44.270
and that we shouldn't bother
ourselves about the Ogres...

15:44.270 --> 15:45.810
But I need to know, no matter what!

15:47.310 --> 15:50.910
Why? Why do the Ogres hate us witches so much?

15:50.910 --> 15:51.950
Please tell me!

15:52.880 --> 15:54.950
That's what you came here to ask me?

15:55.450 --> 15:55.980
Yes.

16:00.340 --> 16:01.820
Chocolat,

16:01.820 --> 16:06.990
the actions you have taken to find the answers to the questions in your mind are admirable.

16:08.360 --> 16:13.660
Courage and intelligence. I can feel
that you have those qualities to be Queen.

16:15.500 --> 16:19.440
Very well. I will answer your questions.

16:19.440 --> 16:21.570
Observe the truth of history.

16:31.590 --> 16:33.020
Long, long ago...

16:35.960 --> 16:42.150
seven wizards ran away from the
Human World and came to this world.

17:06.220 --> 17:10.750
And these seven wizards
created this Magical World.

17:11.560 --> 17:13.330
That is the story of this world's creation.

17:14.630 --> 17:18.300
And among these seven
wizards there was a single male.

17:19.270 --> 17:23.100
The "Ice Prince,'' a powerful wizard named Glace.

17:24.540 --> 17:28.980
He was husband to all six
witches, and was in truth a king, but...

17:31.350 --> 17:32.980
What is he planning to do?

17:34.010 --> 17:37.220
He's trying to control
Le Royaume all by himself.

17:37.220 --> 17:39.790
He tries to please everybody.

17:39.790 --> 17:44.320
That's right... If he can't be mine alone...

18:02.410 --> 18:07.930
The six witches sealed him away, and
his very existence was erased from history.

18:10.850 --> 18:15.990
What is happening? All of
my wives have betrayed me...

18:18.390 --> 18:22.030
Those fools... Those damn foolish women!

18:24.570 --> 18:26.630
He was confined at the ends of the earth.

18:28.000 --> 18:31.990
His remaining descendants were cast out of Le Royaume

18:31.990 --> 18:36.140
to live in the wilderness of the borderland,
were called "Ogres,'' and persecuted.

18:37.850 --> 18:42.780
And now they hate Le Royaume,
and try to fight against us.

18:45.190 --> 18:47.970
Well, who do you think are worse?

18:48.560 --> 18:50.420
The Ogres and their continued hatred...

18:52.530 --> 18:54.490
Or Le Royaume, who persecuted them?

18:57.100 --> 18:59.570
Do we have the right to judge them?

19:02.600 --> 19:03.950
I don't know.

19:04.300 --> 19:06.450
Think upon it, Chocolat.

19:06.870 --> 19:09.710
But the Ogres tried to kill me!

19:10.840 --> 19:13.950
"Eye for an eye," the viscious cycle...

19:16.380 --> 19:18.720
I wish for it to end.

19:20.260 --> 19:23.920
Le Royaume and the Ogres
were originally one people.

19:24.930 --> 19:27.430
I believe that one day things will be settled.

19:28.100 --> 19:31.270
But... not yet.

19:33.270 --> 19:36.000
By no means allow the Ogres to get too close.

19:36.000 --> 19:38.240
But you must not provoke them.

19:39.140 --> 19:40.040
Do you understand?

19:41.280 --> 19:41.840
Yes.

19:45.280 --> 19:47.850
I'm glad I was able to talk to you.

19:47.850 --> 19:51.750
Please do your best along with
Vanilla as Queen Candidates, okay?

19:52.290 --> 19:52.650
I will.

19:59.560 --> 20:03.400
Chocolat-chan, where did
you go? We were worried.

20:03.860 --> 20:06.140
Sorry, I just stopped by La Palais.

20:06.830 --> 20:08.640
I met with Queen Candy.

20:10.140 --> 20:11.270
You met Mama?

20:11.910 --> 20:14.680
But I thought you couldn't get too close to La Palais?

20:14.680 --> 20:16.410
There's supposed to be some sorta strong barrier.

20:16.410 --> 20:18.710
Well, yeah, but I managed, somehow.

20:18.710 --> 20:21.680
Sorry, I figured we'd be
stopped if all of us went together.

20:22.280 --> 20:25.650
Well as long as you came back okay.

20:25.650 --> 20:27.280
So what did the Queen tell you?

20:28.490 --> 20:29.560
She taught me a lot about the Ogres.

20:29.560 --> 20:33.290
And said that she wished
he wouldn't have to fight them.

20:36.400 --> 20:40.330
She didn't see me? But why
did she only see Chocolat-chan?

20:41.640 --> 20:44.900
We've got the think about the
future of the Magical World, you know.

20:45.740 --> 20:48.110
I've got a feeling that we've got to.

20:48.610 --> 20:51.210
Chocolat, it's rare that you're this serious.

20:51.210 --> 20:52.810
Just like a Queen Candidate, eh?

20:53.550 --> 20:55.210
That's not it...

20:55.980 --> 20:59.690
Oh yeah, the Queen told me to tell you
to try hard for the second midterm exam...

20:59.690 --> 21:01.150
coming up for the Queen Candidates, Vanilla.

21:03.290 --> 21:03.860
Vanilla?

21:05.060 --> 21:05.610
Right...

21:05.960 --> 21:07.460
How about the party?

21:07.460 --> 21:09.600
It's still goin' strong!

21:09.600 --> 21:11.230
It'll probably go on all night!

21:11.230 --> 21:13.870
Alright! Let's dance until the morning!

21:13.870 --> 21:15.270
- Yay!
- Yay!

21:19.940 --> 21:23.280
Vanilla, what's wrong? Hurry up!

21:24.040 --> 21:25.780
Yeah, sorry.

21:53.370 --> 21:56.840
The wriggling of a wicked Saule.

21:58.050 --> 22:00.880
The ugly heart of jealousy.

22:02.020 --> 22:03.620
The noir itself is our life.

22:04.690 --> 22:07.890
The day I rule the Human World
and crush Le Royaume draws near.

22:23.120 --> 22:29.450
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.950
"Love"

22:31.860 --> 22:35.370
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.780
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.210 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.960 --> 23:00.230
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.830 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.200 --> 23:11.270
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.640 --> 23:16.080
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.080 --> 23:26.190
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.250 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.200 --> 23:51.140
Ladies and Gentlemen, it's finally time for the second Queen Candidate Midterm exam!

23:51.140 --> 23:53.930
This time they have to act for one day as a manager at the heart factory!

23:53.930 --> 23:57.950
The Queen Candidates have to motivate and organize their workers!

23:57.950 --> 24:01.220
Chocolat, Vanilla, both of you fight bravely!

24:01.220 --> 24:04.620
Alright, this time I ain't gonna lose!

24:04.620 --> 24:06.770
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:06.770 --> 24:11.110
The Ogres Declare War! The Close-Call Crisis at the Heart Factory

24:11.110 --> 24:13.470
If you don't work, I'll whup your butt!

24:13.470 --> 24:14.470
Thanks!
